{"a":[68,68],"h":"<p>Onun için vazifei risaletini temamen iyfa et ve hiç kimseden perva etmiyerek 68. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"50\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 50.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.0 27.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"33.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> de ki<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"265\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 265.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 23.3 34.6 54.8 66.0 66.0 72.8 90.8 90.8 99.8 99.8 106.6 118.6 135.0 135.0 151.6 158.3 165.0 165.0 177.0 177.0 184.6 200.3 210.8 210.8 219.8 235.6 235.6 242.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"34.6 72.8 106.6 118.6 158.3 200.3 219.8 242.3 249.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ey Ehli kitab, siz hiç bir şey üzerinde değilsiniz, ya'ni diyanetiniz yok, din namını verdiğiniz, gittiğiniz yol hiç bir şey değildir. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"442\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 442.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 25.4 25.4 37.4 37.4 37.4 44.2 61.4 61.4 72.0 72.0 87.7 87.7 96.7 96.7 108.7 108.7 115.4 123.0 123.0 138.7 149.2 149.2 156.7 156.7 163.4 163.4 179.2 179.2 186.0 192.7 210.0 220.4 227.2 227.2 240.0 240.0 246.7 246.7 258.7 258.7 265.4 282.7 289.4 296.2 296.2 304.4 304.4 312.7 312.7 319.4 327.0 342.7 349.4 357.7 357.7 366.7 373.4 373.4 380.2 380.2 396.0 407.2 407.2 407.2 414.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\">